sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P as publish.yml
  participant GH as GitHub Releases
  participant S as site.yml
  participant GP as GitHub Pages
  participant CF as Cloudflare Pages
  participant V as verify_live.py
  P->>P: re-verify final set, seal, sign, tar.gz, metadata
  P->>P: verify_release.py on the exact files to publish
  P->>GH: create DRAFT release with every asset
  P->>GH: check the asset count, then publish
  P->>S: request site deployment
  S->>GH: download the release and history
  S->>S: verify_release.py, build catalog and stats, record verification
  S->>GP: deploy
  S->>CF: deploy mirror (preflight first)
  S->>V: verify the public URL
  V->>GP: package, every rule file, catalog, links
  V-->>S: PASS or FAIL logged in the transparency log
